{
  "id": "r1-long-notes",
  "title": "Longer notes: half and whole notes",
  "summary": "Notes that last two beats and four beats.",
  "requires": {
    "pitchStage": "P1",
    "rhythmStage": "R1"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Half notes",
      "text": [
        "A hollow note with a stem is a **half note**. It lasts two beats.",
        "Play it once, then let it ring through the next beat. Count **1 2** for each one."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/h B4/h"]
      },
      "fingering": "none",
      "labels": [
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1 2"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 2,
          "text": "3 4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Whole notes",
      "text": [
        "A hollow note with no stem is a **whole note**. It lasts four beats: a full bar of 4/4.",
        "Play it once and count **1 2 3 4** while it rings."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/w"]
      },
      "fingering": "none",
      "labels": [
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1 2 3 4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "title": "Side by side",
      "text": [
        "Here are all three lengths. The clicks never change speed. Only how long you hold each note changes."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q", "B4/h B4/h", "B4/w"]
      },
      "fingering": "none",
      "labels": [
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 2,
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 3,
          "text": "3"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 4,
          "text": "4"
        },
        {
          "bar": 2,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1 2"
        },
        {
          "bar": 2,
          "note": 2,
          "text": "3 4"
        },
        {
          "bar": 3,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1 2 3 4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "title": "Hold the long ones",
      "text": [
        "Press **Your turn** and keep counting. Let each half note and whole note ring for its full length before you move on."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["G4/q G4/q G4/h", "B4/h B4/h", "E5/q E5/q E5/h", "B4/w"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "title": "Mixed lengths",
      "text": [
        "Quarter, half and whole notes on the open strings. Look at each note's shape as well as its place on the staff."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["G4/h B4/h", "E5/q E5/q B4/h", "G4/q B4/q E5/h", "B4/w"]
      }
    }
  ]
}
